WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:03.650
Wealth, fame, power...

3
00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.440
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.820
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates, obtained everything the world has to offer.

5
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.360
attained this and everything else
the world had to offer.

6
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.820
And his dying words drove
countless souls to the seas.

7
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:11.660
What he said in his final moments drove countless souls to the seas.

8
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.660
You want my treasure?

9
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:13.700
You can have it!

10
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.450
Go ahead.

11
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.040
I left everything I gathered
together in one place.

12
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.660
Find it!

13
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.250
Everything is right where I left it!

14
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.250
Now you just have to find it!

15
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.750
These words lured
men to the Grand Line

16
00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:26.380
People set their sights on the Grand Line in pursuit of their dreams.

17
00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.920
in pursuit of dreams greater than
they'd ever dared to imagine!

18
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.630
The world has truly entered the Great Pirate Era!

19
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.850
This is the time known as
the Great Pirate Era!

20
00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:35.640
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

21
00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:41.440
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

22
00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:42.690
One Piece!

23
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.700
Compasses? Not for me. Left them all behind

24
00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:58.500
I'm headed out to sea, with my heart serving as guide

25
00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
Following the ancient map to the spot marked "X" reveals

26
00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.760
Yeah, it's only legendary till someone proves it's real

27
00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.710
When the world's got you down,

28
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:16.850
lean on your crew, they'll turn it around

29
00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:22.190
Their biorhythm will carry you through

30
00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.230
We're gonna make the most of it

31
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:31.400
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

32
00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:36.990
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

33
00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:40.040
Got some change to my name,

34
00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:43.250
and maybe you wanna be my friend?

35
00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:48.130
We are, we are on the cruise!

36
00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:49.760
WE ARE!

37
00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:53.800
[PIRATE A] He destroyed the fin!

38
00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:56.470
[PIRATES] Whoa!

39
00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:02.690
[KRIEG] He's trying to sink my ship.

40
00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:06.650
You dare defy me!

41
00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:10.440
Ghin, blow his head off right now!

42
00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:11.610
[grunts]

43
00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:13.280
[KRIEG] What are you waiting for?

44
00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:15.160
But... he...

45
00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:17.490
He saved our lives
when we were starving.

46
00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:19.040
He gave us food!

47
00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:21.120
[growling]

48
00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:22.830
Ghin, kill him!

49
00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:23.620
[LUFFY] Hey!

50
00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:26.130
I don't see why you're all so upset.

51
00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:30.000
I didn't sink it.

52
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.550
[grumbling]

53
00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:33.010
Back off, Chore Boy.

54
00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:34.550
It's not your fight!

55
00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:35.550
[LUFFY] But, I will.

56
00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:37.760
What?!

57
00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:39.220
I'm going to sink it.

58
00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:40.890
[COOKS] Huh?

59
00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:42.230
[PIRATES groan]

60
00:02:42.230 --> 00:02:43.430
Aw, c'mon!

61
00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:45.270
[PIRATES yelling]

62
00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:47.900
[SANJI] You bastard,
that's what you're doing?

63
00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:49.270
You can't sink this ship!

64
00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:53.110
But, if the restaurant's gone, there's
no reason to attack then, is there?

65
00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:54.950
[SANJI] No!

66
00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:55.700
[ZEFF] Hm. Hm.

67
00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:57.990
This ship saved my life.

68
00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:02.120
I owe everything to her and
you will not take that away!

69
00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:04.660
You're gonna die for a
dumb, old restaurant?

70
00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:06.500
Are you stupid?

71
00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:08.000
What'd you say?!

72
00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.040
Getting killed?

73
00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:12.920
That's how you wanna repay your debt?

74
00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:16.470
The old man didn't save you so
that you could kill yourself!

75
00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:19.470
He did it so you could do
something with your life!

76
00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:21.430
Not to die like a fool!

77
00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:24.430
And so your big idea is
to help them attack us?

78
00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:27.270
[BOTH growling]

79
00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:28.190
[GHIN grunting]

80
00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:29.810
[PEARL] Boys, there's no
need for friends to fight.

81
00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:34.570
Especially when there's
nothing either of you can do.

82
00:03:34.570 --> 00:03:35.860
Not while there's a big shotgun

83
00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:43.490
pressed right up against
the old man's chef hat!

84
00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:48.000
[PEARL] Fire Pearls!
Now, you will burn!

85
00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:02.050
Ghin!

86
00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:06.060
[groaning] What did... you do... Ghin?

87
00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:07.520
I'm sorry, Pearl.

88
00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:09.020
You're in my way.

89
00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:17.490
Ghin, you have betrayed
your captain and your ship!

90
00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:18.490
[GHIN] I know.

91
00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:19.530
I'm sorry,

92
00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:20.740
I can't kill him.

93
00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:21.780
Not like this.

94
00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.120
He deserves better.

95
00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:25.790
He deserves to face death standing up.

96
00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:31.790
But I promise you...
he'll still die by my hand.

97
00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:36.210
[SANJI grunts]

98
00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:38.130
Oh, great...

99
00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:42.390
My Chief Commander has now
completely lost his marbles.

100
00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:45.350
He's their chief commander?

101
00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:46.310
I guess...

102
00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:48.480
Did ya' see him crush that guy, though?

103
00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:50.810
One blow and his shield was in pieces.

104
00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:53.440
Now, that's power!

105
00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:55.440
[LUFFY] Hmm.

106
00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.650
Ha! My plan worked perfectly!

107
00:04:57.650 --> 00:04:59.240
And now, he's out in the open.

108
00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:00.240
You liar!

109
00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:03.030
There's no way you thought
that this would happen!

110
00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:04.080
[LUFFY] Uh...

111
00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:05.580
[GHIN] Sanji.

112
00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:09.160
I don't want to ruin this ship,
but I think it's too late for that.

113
00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:11.790
[SANJI] you're going to get to this
restaurant without killing me,

114
00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.500
you got another thing coming.

115
00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:14.590
Sounds fair.

116
00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:19.220
Then it will be an absolute pleasure
to kill you... my good friend.

117
00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:22.340
Gee... that's comforting...

118
00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:23.680
Asshole.

119
00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:26.010
[GHIN] You as well, Chore Boy.

120
00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:27.720
[LUFFY] Gee... thanks!

121
00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:30.600
But, I'm not afraid
of any Krieg pirate.

122
00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:31.560
[GHIN grunts]

123
00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:33.020
[PIRATES grumble]

124
00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:34.440
[PIRATE B] Ya' little twerp!

125
00:05:34.440 --> 00:05:37.280
[PIRATE C] Get ready to die, little man!

126
00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:40.700
I'm gonna stuff that stupid
straw hat right down your throat!

127
00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:41.950
[PIRATE D] We're the Krieg Pirates!

128
00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:44.450
Rulers of the East Blue.

129
00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:49.700
Only 'cause you outnumbered the
other pirates in the East Blue.

130
00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:55.880
[PIRATES growling]

131
00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:58.880
Oh, boy... now you
really pissed 'em off.

132
00:05:58.880 --> 00:05:59.840
Guess I was right.

133
00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:01.170
[PIRATE] You're dead meat!

134
00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:03.840
Let's get him!

135
00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:05.300
Hold your place!

136
00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.930
[PIRATE E] But, Don Krieg!

137
00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:09.390
[PIRATE F] He can't say that.

138
00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:14.650
[KRIEG] You only prove his point when you
lose control or whine like little babies!

139
00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:17.060
You see me trembling with anger?

140
00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:19.820
Only the weak react to mere words.

141
00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:22.780
Don Krieg Pirates run from no man!

142
00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:25.280
[PIRATES] Yes, sir!

143
00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:26.120
[KRIEG] Ghin!

144
00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:27.030
[GHIN] Hm?

145
00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:31.080
[KRIEG] It's your job to
take care of that cook!

146
00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.160
I'll handle the little boy.

147
00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:36.130
That brat is all mine.

148
00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:37.540
I understand.

149
00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:38.920
Yes, Don Krieg.

150
00:06:41.590 --> 00:06:43.130
[KRIEG] Hey, Boy!

151
00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:43.840
[LUFFY] Hm?

152
00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:48.350
You can try your devil fruit magic
against me, but I've seen it all before

153
00:06:48.350 --> 00:06:51.520
and have never been
defeated by such trickery.

154
00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:56.150
When you experience the full force
that conquered the entire East Blue,

155
00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:58.860
then you'll understand the
meaning of power, Chore Boy!

156
00:06:58.860 --> 00:07:01.530
Your voice is getting on my nerves.

157
00:07:01.530 --> 00:07:04.450
I'm gonna to kick your ass!
It's as simple as that.

158
00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:05.150
[grunts]

159
00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:07.950
Hold on just a second.

160
00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:10.030
I'll be right there.

161
00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:12.950
[KRIEG growls]
The impudence!

162
00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:18.380
[PIRATE G] That cook is done for now.

163
00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:21.050
[PIRATE H] Yeah, man, when
Ghin takes out his weapons,

164
00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:24.340
he's through screwing
around. Just look at him.

165
00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:32.350
[PIRATE I] They call him,
"The Cold-Hearted Demon."

166
00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:34.850
[PIRATE J K] He's our
cool-headed, cold-hearted,

167
00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:37.770
pirate fleet chief commander, Ghin!

168
00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:39.940
It doesn't matter if you beg for mercy,

169
00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:43.440
he'll still laugh in your
face while he kills you.

170
00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:49.780
[GHIN] I'm sorry, Sanji,
but I can't be defeated.

171
00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:52.910
Yeah, go ahead... tell yourself that.

172
00:07:57.500 --> 00:07:58.500
[SANJI gasps]

173
00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:00.460
[GHIN] Here I come.

174
00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:03.670
– [GHIN grunts]
– [SANJI grunts]

175
00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:04.670
[GHIN] Ha!

176
00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:07.470
[GHIN grunts]

177
00:08:08.720 --> 00:08:11.390
– [SANJI grunts]
– [GHIN chuckles]

178
00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:14.310
[SANJI grunting]

179
00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:15.430
[SANJI] You son of a...

180
00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:18.560
[GHIN] Ha. Ha.

181
00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:20.310
[SANJI gulps, grunts]

182
00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:24.320
Sanji!

183
00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:29.410
[SANJI grunting]

184
00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:32.070
[GHIN] Heh. And now...

185
00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:33.080
[SANJI gasps]

186
00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:36.040
... it's time for you to accept defeat.

187
00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:45.340
[PIRATES cheering]

188
00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:49.180
[COOKS gasping]

189
00:08:54.850 --> 00:08:56.180
Die!

190
00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:59.690
[GHIN grunts]

191
00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:22.710
[PIRATES] That cook
kicked Ghin in the head!

192
00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:25.460
Yeah, I couldn't believe it.

193
00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:27.250
Do you think he's still alive?

194
00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:28.090
[KRIEG] Enough!

195
00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:34.220
After all this time, you should know
a hell of a lot better than that, you idiots.

196
00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:38.020
There's a reason I trust him
above any of my other pirate crew.

197
00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:40.850
Ghin is always a cool-headed,
cold-hearted demon,

198
00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:42.190
and he never quits!

199
00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:52.490
I can't believe Sanji is getting up!

200
00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:54.240
He should lie back down.

201
00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:57.790
After what he's been through,
his ribs must be completely smashed!

202
00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:06.040
Well... that... wasn't...
too bad... Chief Commander.

203
00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:10.880
[SANJI] Lemme know when
you're ready to really fight.

204
00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:20.100
[LUFFY] He's just sitting there.

205
00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:21.980
[laughs]

206
00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:24.560
Now, it's ass kickin' time!

207
00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:25.810
[KRIEG] Hm?

208
00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:30.030
[LUFFY yelling]

209
00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:32.360
Don't hurt yourself.

210
00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:34.450
[LUFFY] Huh?

211
00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:36.910
[LUFFY yells]

212
00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:40.740
[LUFFY gasps, screams]

213
00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:43.160
[LUFFY grunts]

214
00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:46.670
[laughing]

215
00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:47.880
You're a bastard!

216
00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.630
Don't you want to fight me?

217
00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:51.710
Fight you?

218
00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:53.420
Do I really have to?

219
00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:57.800
If all I want to do is kill
you, that's enough for me.

220
00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:03.890
I really don't have any patience
for your stupid games, little fool.

221
00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.020
Oh, yeah?

222
00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:07.770
How about I bite your head off!

223
00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:09.110
– [thudding]
– [PIRATES laugh]

224
00:11:09.110 --> 00:11:10.820
[laughing]

225
00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:12.940
[PIRATES cheering]

226
00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:16.530
[LUFFY gasps] Sanji!

227
00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:20.120
[coughing]

228
00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:24.210
Pfft.

229
00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:25.210
[PIRATE N] Woo hoo!

230
00:11:25.210 --> 00:11:27.370
Pulverize the rest of him!

231
00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:29.170
[PIRATE O] Yeah, what he said!

232
00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:32.170
Crap! If only he hadn't
fought that Pearl guy first!

233
00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:35.840
Yeah, I don't think he'll survive
another hit from those balls.

234
00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:37.890
[SANJI grunting]

235
00:11:37.890 --> 00:11:41.560
[SANJI] Go ahead... you
hit like a girl, anyway.

236
00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:43.470
[GHIN chuckles]

237
00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:48.850
[SANJI grunting]

238
00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:55.570
[SANJI] He's too strong for me.

239
00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:02.160
Now, die!

240
00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:03.540
Bye, Sanji.

241
00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:05.330
[GHIN yells]

242
00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:06.830
[SANJI, GHIN grunting]

243
00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:09.250
What was that? Your pity?

244
00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:10.920
[GHIN] Huh?

245
00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:14.590
– [GHIN yells]
– [SANJI] I'm not dead yet.

246
00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:15.920
[PIRATE P] Chief Commander!

247
00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:19.760
– [bones cracking]
– [SANJI groaning]

248
00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:21.600
Oh, no!

249
00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:24.100
[SANJI grunting]

250
00:12:24.100 --> 00:12:25.640
Ah! No!

251
00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:26.980
He can't take it!

252
00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:29.270
He's gonna kill himself
just trying to fight!

253
00:12:29.270 --> 00:12:33.070
[SANJI gasping]

254
00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:36.110
[GHIN grunting]

255
00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:38.110
– [bones crackling]
– [SANJI groaning]

256
00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:41.120
[KRIEG chuckles]

257
00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:52.960
[PIRATES chattering]

258
00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:57.670
[SANJI] You damn bastard.

259
00:12:57.670 --> 00:12:59.800
[SANJI grunts]

260
00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:01.140
[LUFFY gasps]

261
00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:02.760
[PATTY, CARNE gasp]

262
00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:21.700
[whimpers]

263
00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:24.780
[GHIN] I can't...

264
00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:27.450
I can't obey your order.

265
00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:30.710
[whimpering continues]

266
00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:32.960
I can't, Don Krieg!

267
00:13:32.920 --> 00:13:35.170
[GHIN] This man saved my life.

268
00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:38.630
[KRIEG] What did you say?!

269
00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:41.720
I won't do it!

270
00:13:44.350 --> 00:13:46.350
[GHIN] Take it and leave me alone!

271
00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:53.690
[GHIN] I'm sorry...

272
00:13:53.690 --> 00:13:56.360
I'm sorry... thank you, so much.

273
00:13:56.360 --> 00:14:01.240
I thought it was over, I truly
thought I was going to die.

274
00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:04.740
[GHIN sobs]

275
00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:07.410
[GHIN] This food... it's delicious.

276
00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:09.950
I've never eaten food this good before.

277
00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:11.830
Of course it is.

278
00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:14.460
[sobbing continues]

279
00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:22.090
Sorry. You'll probably
get yelled at, or fired

280
00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:24.050
'cause you gave me that food for free.

281
00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:25.010
Now there's not proof,

282
00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:26.890
so there's no way for
me to get yelled at.

283
00:14:26.890 --> 00:14:31.730
[GHIN whimpers]

284
00:14:31.730 --> 00:14:34.100
[GHIN] He treated me with such respect,

285
00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:38.860
and decency, and kindness.

286
00:14:38.860 --> 00:14:44.200
That's why... I can't
bring myself to kill him.

287
00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:46.740
Don't get caught again.

288
00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:50.120
[GHIN] I've always been loyal to you.

289
00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:53.870
Up till now, I've believed
in what we've done.

290
00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:58.130
I respect you and appreciate
all you have given me.

291
00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:02.970
Trusting me as your Chief
Commander was the honor of my life.

292
00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:06.840
Until this moment, I have obeyed
every single order you have given me

293
00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:09.010
without ever questioning it.

294
00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:15.140
I can't live with myself if I kill this man...
and I cannot break my oath.

295
00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:18.270
Please, I beg you.

296
00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:22.610
Let me disobey just this one order!

297
00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:23.990
Please!

298
00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:27.570
[GHIN] Don Krieg...

299
00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:30.160
Listen...

300
00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:31.620
Can't we just leave?

301
00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:34.620
They can keep the
restaurant for themselves.

302
00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:38.330
[yelling] You little son of a bitch!

303
00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:42.960
You think you can defy my orders
and then tell me what to do?

304
00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.470
[KRIEG] It's pathetic.

305
00:15:46.180 --> 00:15:48.260
Morality, sympathy...

306
00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:51.560
Weaknesses I never
expected to see from you.

307
00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:54.980
You are not my Chief Commander anymore!

308
00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:58.730
Pirates?

309
00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:00.110
Step aside.

310
00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:03.900
No! Not the gas!

311
00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:06.280
[PIRATES yelling]

312
00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:08.820
[PIRATE Q] He's going to use the MH5!

313
00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:11.410
[PIRATE R] We're all gonna die!

314
00:16:11.410 --> 00:16:13.160
– What?!
– Poison gas!

315
00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:14.910
[PIRATE S yelling]
Where's my mask?!

316
00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:16.250
[PIRATE T] Masks on!

317
00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:17.750
[PIRATE U] Move it, move it!

318
00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:19.040
[PIRATE V] He's using MH5!

319
00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:20.420
[PIRATE A] Gas is a coward's weapon!

320
00:16:20.420 --> 00:16:23.050
[PIRATE B] You bastard,
you'll kill us all!

321
00:16:23.050 --> 00:16:27.130
The only thing that matters in
a battle is who ends up winning,

322
00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:30.050
even if more have got to die.

323
00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:34.180
Poison gas is just a means to an end.

324
00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:38.270
Victory is all that decides
what's right and what's wrong.

325
00:16:38.270 --> 00:16:42.980
If you are dead, nobody's
gonna hear you complain anyway.

326
00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:46.150
When you don't hesitate
to do unspeakable,

327
00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:51.950
horrible things... that, is true power.

328
00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:54.370
[LUFFY growls]

329
00:16:54.370 --> 00:16:55.910
He's insane.

330
00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:01.880
[GHIN grunts]

331
00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:05.170
Might as well throw that gas mask away!

332
00:17:06.550 --> 00:17:10.300
You're no longer worthy
to be a Krieg Pirate.

333
00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:13.050
Die!

334
00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:19.060
[LUFFY yelling]

335
00:17:19.060 --> 00:17:22.730
[LUFFY] I'm not going to let
that happen, you bastard!

336
00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:25.690
You're wasting your time, Chore Boy!

337
00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:29.030
[LUFFY yelping]

338
00:17:29.030 --> 00:17:30.780
[LUFFY gasps]

339
00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:33.240
[LUFFY yelling]

340
00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:38.750
[LUFFY grunting]

341
00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:41.290
[LUFFY] Aw, crap!

342
00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:43.380
Ghin!

343
00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:48.960
You don't have to listen to that blowhard,
because I'm gonna kick his ass!

344
00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:49.800
[GHIN growls]

345
00:17:49.800 --> 00:17:53.760
No! My captain cannot be defeated!

346
00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:58.600
Don Krieg is the strongest man
alive and I respect his punishment.

347
00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:00.810
Will you please snap out of it?

348
00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:03.900
He's going to kill you!

349
00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:05.360
I deserve it.

350
00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:08.480
Obeying my emotions meant
betraying my captain.

351
00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:12.360
If I were in his position, then
I would've done the same thing.

352
00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:15.200
And now, death is the
only honor I have left.

353
00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:18.790
Don't!

354
00:18:18.790 --> 00:18:20.370
[SANJI] Why? No...

355
00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:24.630
Heh. So, you've remembered your place.

356
00:18:24.630 --> 00:18:26.420
But, it's much too late for that.

357
00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:29.880
Now, you will both die together.

358
00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:32.550
It's the MH5 Poison...

359
00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:34.130
Gas Bomb...

360
00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:35.140
Fire!

361
00:18:42.270 --> 00:18:44.350
[PATTY] Get inside the restaurant!

362
00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:49.570
– [LUFFY] Thank you!
– [PIRATES gasp]

363
00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:53.320
Sanji, Ghin, catch!

364
00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:54.990
Now, for mine.

365
00:18:54.990 --> 00:18:57.320
Ah! Where'd they go?

366
00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:18.970
[KRIEG] This, is power.

367
00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:36.150
[LUFFY huffs]
I'm alive!

368
00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:38.490
That mask appeared just in time.

369
00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:46.750
[COOK J] What a crazy bastard!

370
00:19:46.750 --> 00:19:48.290
[COOK K] He tried to kill us all.

371
00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.090
That guy's gotta be insane.

372
00:19:50.090 --> 00:19:52.250
[COOK L] I can't believe
he used poison gas.

373
00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:53.380
[COOK JJ] He must be a demon.

374
00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:55.920
No human would do that.

375
00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:58.260
[BOTH growling]

376
00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:10.730
Do ya' think Sanji and
the Chore Boy made it?

377
00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:11.860
I don't know.

378
00:20:11.860 --> 00:20:14.860
Look, the poison gas is clearing up.

379
00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:25.790
[SANJI] Ghin!

380
00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:31.250
[SANJI] Let go.

381
00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:33.130
You can let go now.

382
00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:36.920
Hey, Ghin, are you okay?

383
00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:40.840
[GHIN gasping]

384
00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:44.390
It's your mask... you gave it to me.

385
00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:45.220
[GHIN groans]

386
00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:46.060
[LUFFY] No!

387
00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:48.390
[KRIEG laughing]

388
00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:49.900
[KRIEG] What a fool!

389
00:20:49.900 --> 00:20:54.110
You are paying for a plate
of food with your life.

390
00:20:54.110 --> 00:20:55.320
Oh, well.

391
00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:58.820
Maybe you'll learn...
when you're dead. Heh!

392
00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:03.740
[KRIEG laughing]

393
00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:09.750
Ghin...

394
00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:19.880
So, it seems...

395
00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:24.680
Don Krieg was not the right
man for you to follow, was he?

396
00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:28.310
[KRIEG laughing]

397
00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:31.350
[KRIEG] It figures that you still
feel for that pathetic scum.

398
00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:31.980
[SANJI] Scum?!

399
00:21:31.980 --> 00:21:32.940
[KRIEG] That's right.

400
00:21:32.940 --> 00:21:37.570
Anyone who loses focus and betrays
my ship, is worthless to me.

401
00:21:37.570 --> 00:21:39.820
They'll almost certainly do it again.

402
00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:42.110
Putting him out of his
misery is an act of mercy

403
00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:46.540
to keep him from dishonoring himself
in the future and endangering my crew.

404
00:21:46.540 --> 00:21:48.040
But... he just...

405
00:21:48.040 --> 00:21:51.210
I never thought the captain
would kill his chief commander!

406
00:21:51.210 --> 00:21:51.870
I know!

407
00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:56.000
Ghin has been his right hand man for even
longer than I've been part of the crew.

408
00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:59.010
That's right, see, no one's
ever showed more loyalty

409
00:21:59.010 --> 00:22:02.130
to Don Krieg than Ghin
has over the years.

410
00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:05.970
How could he forget what Ghin did for us
after we escaped from the Grand Line

411
00:22:05.970 --> 00:22:07.970
and Fullbody's Marines were after us?

412
00:22:07.970 --> 00:22:09.640
It was a miracle we escaped!

413
00:22:09.640 --> 00:22:14.230
[PIRATE J] Yeah, he was willing to sacrifice
his life for us by acting as a decoy.

414
00:22:14.230 --> 00:22:16.900
Without him, we wouldn't
have made it out of there.

415
00:22:16.900 --> 00:22:20.030
Ghin's laid down his life for
Don Krieg a hundred times, easy.

416
00:22:20.030 --> 00:22:21.860
I can't believe the
captain would kill him

417
00:22:22.450 --> 00:22:23.700
with such little care.

418
00:22:23.700 --> 00:22:26.660
[panting, coughing]

419
00:22:26.660 --> 00:22:28.410
That's so cruel.

420
00:22:28.410 --> 00:22:31.040
Patty, get the kit, hurry!

421
00:22:31.040 --> 00:22:32.710
It's for food poisoning.

422
00:22:32.710 --> 00:22:34.830
I don't think it will
work on gas, Sanji.

423
00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:36.840
I don't care! We have to try!

424
00:22:36.840 --> 00:22:38.300
Put the mask on em'.

425
00:22:38.300 --> 00:22:40.960
It will detoxify the gas in his lungs.

426
00:22:40.960 --> 00:22:43.300
Then, bring him upstairs
and let him breathe.

427
00:22:43.300 --> 00:22:45.890
It's the only chance
we have to save him.

428
00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:48.970
[GHIN coughing]

429
00:22:50.560 --> 00:22:52.270
Patty, Carne, hurry!

430
00:22:52.270 --> 00:22:53.270
Help me!

431
00:22:53.270 --> 00:22:54.810
[PATTY] All right already!

432
00:22:54.810 --> 00:22:57.810
[CARNE] Me too? All right, I'm comin'.

433
00:22:57.810 --> 00:22:59.770
Ha! It's no use.

434
00:22:59.770 --> 00:23:02.610
He's going to die within the hour.

435
00:23:04.650 --> 00:23:06.530
[LUFFY] Don't you dare die, Ghin.

436
00:23:07.070 --> 00:23:10.830
[LUFFY] You can't let
someone like him win.

437
00:23:12.120 --> 00:23:14.160
Stick around. Now, I'm mad!

438
00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:17.080
You'll wanna see what I'm
going to do to him next!

439
00:23:17.080 --> 00:23:22.420
[GHIN grunting]
You can't defeat him.

440
00:23:22.420 --> 00:23:23.550
Wait a second.

441
00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:25.380
Attacking him head on
is exactly what he wants!

442
00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:27.300
He's strongest that way.

443
00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:31.260
I'm not worried.

444
00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:32.270
[gasps]

445
00:23:32.270 --> 00:23:34.560
[LUFFY] Go ahead
and give it your best shot!

446
00:23:34.560 --> 00:23:35.730
[SANJI] Don't!

447
00:23:35.730 --> 00:23:40.900
Dumb kid. When you lose your
patience, you become easy prey!

448
00:23:40.900 --> 00:23:43.780
You are only running toward
one thing, Chore Boy.

449
00:23:43.780 --> 00:23:45.650
And that is...

450
00:23:45.650 --> 00:23:46.320
He's dead.

451
00:23:46.320 --> 00:23:47.320
Really dead.

452
00:23:47.320 --> 00:23:48.780
... your funeral.

453
00:23:48.780 --> 00:23:50.330
[LUFFY] My funeral?

454
00:23:55.750 --> 00:23:57.750
Oh, no, get out of there!

455
00:24:00.380 --> 00:24:01.340
He got hit!

456
00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:08.430
He's done!

457
00:24:08.430 --> 00:24:10.390
Poor guy.

458
00:24:13.100 --> 00:24:14.680
[KRIEG] Huh...

459
00:24:15.310 --> 00:24:17.520
[LUFFY] Gum-Gum...

460
00:24:17.520 --> 00:24:18.810
Heh... C'mon!

461
00:24:18.810 --> 00:24:19.520
The spikes!

462
00:24:19.520 --> 00:24:20.230
Here we go!

463
00:24:20.230 --> 00:24:22.440
[KRIEG] Just try it!

464
00:24:22.440 --> 00:24:23.940
He's got no place to hit!

465
00:24:26.570 --> 00:24:28.320
[LUFFY] ... Pistol!

466
00:24:29.410 --> 00:24:31.530
Ah! No!

467
00:24:47.090 --> 00:24:48.300
[PIRATE Z] Don Krieg is down!

468
00:24:48.300 --> 00:24:49.970
That punk got him!

469
00:24:49.970 --> 00:24:52.050
[PIRATE J] What is that kid, anyway?

470
00:24:52.050 --> 00:24:55.180
He punched him right
through the spikes!

471
00:24:59.100 --> 00:25:00.980
[PIRATE Z] That's messed up!

472
00:25:00.980 --> 00:25:05.360
[PIRATE J] I've never seen him get hit
in any kind of fight, ever!

473
00:25:05.360 --> 00:25:08.110
[PIRATE A] He busted right
through that porcupine cape

474
00:25:08.110 --> 00:25:10.030
and smashed him right in the face!

475
00:25:10.030 --> 00:25:12.700
[PIRATE Z] I... I can't believe it!

476
00:25:19.290 --> 00:25:23.080
[LUFFY grunts]
So, is this my funeral?

477
00:25:23.080 --> 00:25:25.250
Or yours?

478
00:25:25.250 --> 00:25:26.920
You can't kill me...

479
00:25:26.920 --> 00:25:31.180
[LUFFY grunts]
... with little spikes!

480
00:25:31.180 --> 00:25:34.300
My funeral...

481
00:25:34.300 --> 00:25:36.720
[LUFFY grunts] ... will
take more than this!

482
00:25:37.770 --> 00:25:39.520
[LUFFY pants]

483
00:25:39.520 --> 00:25:45.820
[LUFFY] You'll have to do better than
that... if you wanna beat me.

484
00:25:48.570 --> 00:25:51.610
Because I don't think it's
time for me to die, just yet.

485
00:26:09.260 --> 00:26:11.630
I know one thing, he's nuts.

486
00:26:15.680 --> 00:26:19.220
I've seen one or two like him before.

487
00:26:19.220 --> 00:26:21.060
Stubborn kids who'd rather die,

488
00:26:21.060 --> 00:26:25.270
than have to turn away from
a fight, once it's started.

489
00:26:25.270 --> 00:26:26.940
He'll stay.

490
00:26:26.940 --> 00:26:29.480
That's for sure.

491
00:26:29.480 --> 00:26:32.860
I'm glad he's with us, 'cause
guys like that are hell to fight.

492
00:26:35.820 --> 00:26:38.830
[ZEFF] I don't care if he wins or loses,

493
00:26:38.830 --> 00:26:43.000
I consider it an honor,
just to be able to watch him.

